          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP757 - Vermilion River View

Probably my last time in Vermilion before the takedown. This was brass capping at its easiest - metal post, hole in the ground, no mud, clear digits. Thanks for putting another one in Vermilion!&lt;/p&gt;

