          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP757 - Vermilion River View&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After our stop at the Mann Lake Cap we enjoyed the short drive and even had the good fortune of picking up a select number of Iron Horse caches on the way to this cap site. Stride had this one in the bag before I made out of the car - nice spot - thanks OFTH for setting it up.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
