          <groundspeak:date>2017-01-14T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="985002">Strider&#39;s Ride</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP757 - Vermilion River View&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fresh from finding a few caches along the Iron Horse Trail, we arrived here in the early evening darkness. Although the view wasn't particularly noteworthy, the cap was quickly located, info gathered and before you knew it, we were back on the road...mission accomplished.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;TFTCap ofth!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
